#!/bin/sh
set -e

cat <<'MSG'

icinga2-incident-io installed.

Next, on THIS master:

  1. cp /etc/icinga2/conf.d/incident-io-secrets.conf.example \
        /etc/icinga2/conf.d/incident-io-secrets.conf
  2. Edit it: set IncidentIoUrl and IncidentIoToken from your
     incident.io Icinga 2 alert source.
  3. chown root:icinga /etc/icinga2/conf.d/incident-io-secrets.conf
     chmod 0640        /etc/icinga2/conf.d/incident-io-secrets.conf
  4. icinga2 daemon -C && systemctl reload icinga2

Then opt objects in with  vars.incident_io = true

Install this package on EVERY master in the master zone. Nothing is
distributed by zone sync: the config lives in conf.d on each master.

MSG

exit 0
